Let $A_W$ be the number of articles Meredith wrote on Wednesday. We are given that $A_W = 2 \times A_T = 2 \times 7 = 14$.
The total number of articles written is $A_M + A_T + A_W = 5 + 7 + 14 = 26$.
Each article takes 4 hours to write, so the total number of hours is $26 \times 4 = 104$.

